1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 45=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:42,510
Your Lordship!

7
00:01:43,310 --> 00:01:44,200
Your Lordship!

8
00:01:48,710 --> 00:01:49,640
Your Lordship!

9
00:01:50,230 --> 00:01:50,920
Your Lordship!

10
00:01:55,416 --> 00:01:57,400
While Marquis Yuan
was inspecting the coast,

11
00:01:57,704 --> 00:01:59,560
his soldiers
accidentally drank poisoned water

12
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,640
and were then ambushed by pirates.

13
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:04,920
Marquis Yuan

14
00:02:07,510 --> 00:02:08,910
was killed.

15
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,310
Chengze...

16
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:18,520
is dead?

17
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,910
Is the news confirmed?

18
00:02:29,870 --> 00:02:30,750
Your Lordship sent me

19
00:02:30,750 --> 00:02:32,120
to warn Marquis Yuan.

20
00:02:32,248 --> 00:02:34,712
But by the time I reached
the Zhejiang coast, it was too late.

21
00:02:35,272 --> 00:02:37,190
I only found Ding Peng,
who was badly wounded.

22
00:02:40,248 --> 00:02:42,808
He told me to get this to Your Lordship
as soon as possible.

23
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,000
I returned to Jinling too late,

24
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:47,896
so I had no choice but to sneak
into the residence despite the curfew.

25
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,150
Du Cuique.

26
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,910
It's all my fault.

27
00:03:10,470 --> 00:03:13,120
Why didn't I kill her
when I had the chance?

28
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:18,870
Ding Peng also said

29
00:03:19,150 --> 00:03:20,960
Du Cuique's next target
is the Lin Residence.

30
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:22,590
Your Lordship,

31
00:03:22,824 --> 00:03:24,856
please make preparations
as soon as possible.

32
00:03:30,910 --> 00:03:32,750
I'll go to Duke Xiangguo right now

33
00:03:32,808 --> 00:03:34,760
and ask him
to send someone else to the capital.

34
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,120
I'll stay and wait for Du Cuique.

35
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:36,744
Your Lordship!

36
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:37,560
When she comes,

37
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,190
I'll make her pay for Chengze's death!

38
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,560
Your Lordship!

39
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,360
Your Lordship!

40
00:03:48,710 --> 00:03:50,710
Chengze once saved my life...

41
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,240
I know.

42
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:57,120
Chengze once saved my life!

43
00:04:00,100 --> 00:04:06,660
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

44
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:11,360
If not for Commander Yuan waking me
up with a few words, there would

45
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:13,830
never have been an Assistant Commander
Lin who traded his brush for a sword.

46
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,360
In private, just call me Yuan.

47
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,990
I am an official of the imperial court.

48
00:04:17,048 --> 00:04:18,600
I have not failed His Majesty's trust,

49
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,510
nor have I failed the people.

50
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:24,270
Please help the Crown Prince
leave Jinling, Fengtai.

51
00:04:24,510 --> 00:04:25,720
Thank you for your help today.

52
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:26,950
We're family.

53
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:27,720
It's only right.

54
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:28,630
Brother-in-law,

55
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,720
you'll have to endure
some hardship tonight.

56
00:04:31,368 --> 00:04:33,560
To rise above others
and bring honor to one's family,

57
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,600
what's wrong with that?

58
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:36,888
Shouldn't a man seek high office
and generous rewards,

59
00:04:36,936 --> 00:04:38,560
and win honors
for his wife and children?

60
00:04:39,630 --> 00:04:41,160
The eunuchs wield great power now.

61
00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:44,310
You must be careful.

62
00:04:46,010 --> 00:04:50,040
♪With what I know and what I do♪

63
00:04:50,250 --> 00:04:53,210
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

64
00:04:53,340 --> 00:04:55,650
♪The long night is almost over♪

65
00:04:55,920 --> 00:05:04,040
♪I won't dwell on the past anymore♪

66
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:09,170
♪With my own hands and heart♪

67
00:05:09,170 --> 00:05:12,690
♪I write my name♪

68
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:16,400
♪Through countless lines of ink♪

69
00:05:16,590 --> 00:05:19,890
♪Step by step toward the light♪

70
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:24,040
♪With what I know and what I do♪

71
00:05:24,260 --> 00:05:27,430
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

72
00:05:27,430 --> 00:05:29,780
♪The long night is almost over♪

73
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:32,830
Come take a look!

74
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:33,920
Come and see!

75
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:36,040
Everyone,

76
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:37,070
take a good look!

77
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:38,160
See for yourselves!

78
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,270
(Notice)

79
00:05:39,270 --> 00:05:41,720
Anyone who reports
a lead to the authorities

80
00:05:42,070 --> 00:05:44,160
will be rewarded twenty taels of silver.

81
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:47,310
Anyone who helps
the authorities capture the fugitive

82
00:05:47,950 --> 00:05:50,510
will be rewarded fifty taels of silver.

83
00:05:50,750 --> 00:05:52,830
The fugitive Du Cuique,
a native of Jinzhou,

84
00:05:53,190 --> 00:05:55,750
(Wanted)
born into a military household,

85
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,310
fled to escape her sentence of exile.

86
00:05:57,390 --> 00:06:00,360
She willingly sank into depravity and
became involved with a pirate leader.

87
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:02,390
She then conspired with his men

88
00:06:02,472 --> 00:06:04,008
to poison and kill the pirate chief.

89
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:09,720
Strike a man in the face
and attack his sorest point.

90
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,430
Such underhanded tactics

91
00:06:14,070 --> 00:06:15,480
would never occur to someone

92
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,990
of Lin Jinqi's privileged upbringing.

93
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:20,750
Only that lowly servant Xu Lanxiang

94
00:06:21,310 --> 00:06:23,070
knows what I want

95
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:24,360
and what I despise.

96
00:06:25,190 --> 00:06:26,600
I'll kill Xu Lanxiang for you

97
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:29,830
and wash away today's humiliation
with her blood.

98
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:35,190
This time, I'll do it myself.

99
00:06:38,630 --> 00:06:41,190
I'll kill Xu Lanxiang with my own hands.

100
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:03,240
Attendant Eunuch Mao, please sit.

101
00:07:03,750 --> 00:07:04,600
I wouldn't dare.

102
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:06,904
Now that the new Emperor
has ascended the throne,

103
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,670
there is a new Chief Eunuch
of the Directorate of Ceremonial.

104
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:10,310
A new sovereign brings new officials.

105
00:07:11,096 --> 00:07:12,510
I'm no longer an Attendant Eunuch,

106
00:07:12,568 --> 00:07:14,070
just a lowly eunuch with no standing.

107
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:16,390
Madam, just call me Mao.

108
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:43,310
Lin Jinqi suddenly fell seriously ill
and asked Duke Xiangguo for sick leave

109
00:07:43,390 --> 00:07:44,728
to recuperate at his residence.

110
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:47,510
I hear he's quite seriously ill.

111
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:50,290
The Fourth Young Lady of the Lin family
has already returned home.

112
00:07:50,376 --> 00:07:52,750
Even the Third Young Lady,
who was only recently widowed,

113
00:07:52,830 --> 00:07:54,800
has had to set aside
Marquis Yongchang's funeral arrangements

114
00:07:54,830 --> 00:07:56,376
and is trying to return to her family.

115
00:07:56,488 --> 00:07:59,048
She and the Yuan family are now locked
in a bitter dispute.

116
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,120
At present,

117
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,480
troops from all quarters

118
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:08,950
are rushing
to the capital as reinforcements.

119
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:12,000
There is no one left
in Jinling to spare.

120
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:21,310
Why would Duke Xiangguo agree
to let Lin Jinqi take leave?

121
00:08:22,310 --> 00:08:23,510
When illness strikes,

122
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,560
even Duke Xiangguo cannot defy fate.

123
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,680
With no other choice,

124
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:30,510
his son, Assistant Commander Xu,

125
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:32,728
will have to escort
the provisions in Lin Jinqi's place.

126
00:08:38,550 --> 00:08:40,720
I'm sure you still have instructions
for Mister Zhang.

127
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,440
I'll wait outside.

128
00:08:54,424 --> 00:08:56,520
I'll go with you to take revenge
on the Lin family.

129
00:08:56,750 --> 00:08:58,790
Let the third chief handle
the provisions.

130
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,870
I went to great lengths

131
00:09:06,630 --> 00:09:08,670
to use revenge as a diversion,

132
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:11,320
drawing Lin Jinqi away
from the real target

133
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:14,320
and keeping him in the city.

134
00:09:15,750 --> 00:09:17,670
You said Lin Jinqi was difficult
to deal with.

135
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:22,630
Tonight, I'm only putting on a show.

136
00:09:23,150 --> 00:09:24,600
My goal isn't revenge,

137
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:28,960
but to burn the provisions.

138
00:09:30,510 --> 00:09:31,480
Without those provisions,

139
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:34,240
the capital is certain to fall.

140
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:37,480
Once the Wona army destroys
the imperial court,

141
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:40,270
I will no longer be a pirate,

142
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:44,240
but the King of Jinling.

143
00:10:01,510 --> 00:10:02,320
Just wait.

144
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:05,030
Tonight, I'll set a fire for you

145
00:10:06,550 --> 00:10:09,200
that lights up
the entire city of Jinling.

146
00:10:39,540 --> 00:10:43,340
(Glorify the Family Name)

147
00:11:08,140 --> 00:11:11,180
(Yuan Jiaming, age eleven)

148
00:11:12,020 --> 00:11:14,700
(Yuan Jiaqin, age thirteen.
Yuan Jiawei, age fourteen)

149
00:11:24,750 --> 00:11:25,670
All these years,

150
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:28,030
things between Xiuru and Marquis Yuan

151
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,790
weren't as they once were,

152
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:32,320
but now that he's suddenly gone,

153
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,270
I'm afraid Xiuru

154
00:11:35,208 --> 00:11:36,960
won't be able
to accept it for some time.

155
00:11:40,030 --> 00:11:41,750
If this were the old Xiuru,

156
00:11:42,510 --> 00:11:43,960
she'd already be in tears.

157
00:11:45,390 --> 00:11:47,030
But with the way she is now,

158
00:11:48,248 --> 00:11:49,750
I can't quite tell how she'll react.

159
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,870
I don't even know how to comfort her.

160
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,270
What matters most right now

161
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:59,600
is dealing with that
murderous ghost, Du Cuique.

162
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:01,870
Xiuwan is right.

163
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:30,080
I'll sleep beside you tonight.

164
00:12:33,352 --> 00:12:35,448
Since we're all sleeping
on the floor anyway,

165
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,440
I'll sleep on the outside

166
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,600
and protect you.

167
00:12:39,790 --> 00:12:40,750
I'm the eldest sister.

168
00:12:40,904 --> 00:12:42,970
If anyone should face danger first,
it should be me.

169
00:12:43,150 --> 00:12:44,104
It's not your turn yet.

170
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:51,390
What are you two arguing over?

171
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,000
Suhua.

172
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,080
- Suhua.
- Suhua.

173
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,240
Xiulai.

174
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:56,550
Where's Lanxiang?

175
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:01,030
After Lanxiang picked me up,

176
00:13:01,270 --> 00:13:04,030
she went straight to take care
of Uncle Xu and Aunt Guihua.

177
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,790
Look how fast I can fly.

178
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:22,000
Zhangcheng,

179
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,000
no more running around.

180
00:13:23,910 --> 00:13:25,870
Let me test you on a few characters.

181
00:13:30,488 --> 00:13:31,390
Come on, Mother.

182
00:13:31,390 --> 00:13:32,630
"Child."

183
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:33,320
"Grandchild."

184
00:13:33,550 --> 00:13:35,120
You know "grandchild", too?

185
00:13:35,510 --> 00:13:39,000
You're Grandpa's granddaughter.

186
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:45,720
"From child to grandchild,
down to great-great-grandchild."

187
00:13:45,784 --> 00:13:46,664
"Great-grandchild."

188
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:48,270
You know "great-grandchild", too?

189
00:13:51,550 --> 00:13:52,240
Xu.

190
00:13:54,670 --> 00:13:55,720
See for yourself.

191
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:56,910
I've finished it.

192
00:13:57,910 --> 00:13:58,360
Good.

193
00:14:03,150 --> 00:14:05,000
Go on. Get back to what you need to do.

194
00:14:05,870 --> 00:14:07,030
Your father

195
00:14:07,790 --> 00:14:09,240
and Zhangcheng are here with me.

196
00:14:09,670 --> 00:14:10,670
That's enough.

197
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,240
Go on.

198
00:14:21,672 --> 00:14:23,080
I've been an unfilial daughter.

199
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:25,270
Mother, even while you're ill,

200
00:14:25,464 --> 00:14:27,480
I can't stay home
and care for you in peace.

201
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:32,000
My precious darling now

202
00:14:32,670 --> 00:14:33,840
is Zhangcheng.

203
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:35,150
Just seeing her

204
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,030
makes me happy.

205
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:43,870
As for you,
you'll have to take second place.

206
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:49,510
Seeing Grandma makes me happiest, too.

207
00:14:50,550 --> 00:14:51,480
Is that so?

208
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:58,600
Lanxiang,

209
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:00,840
go on.

210
00:15:02,790 --> 00:15:03,440
Go.

211
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,080
Go.

212
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:13,600
Go on.

213
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:16,720
Grandma,

214
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:19,200
Grandpa made these
two little birds for me.

215
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:20,840
I'll give you one.

216
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:38,630
It's flying!

217
00:15:38,670 --> 00:15:40,510
It's flying so high!

218
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:41,870
Grandma,

219
00:15:41,910 --> 00:15:43,240
you have to get well soon.

220
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:45,670
Then I can tell you stories
from the plays.

221
00:15:53,270 --> 00:15:55,080
The courtyard gate will be locked soon.

222
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:57,360
Father, make sure you bolt the door.

223
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:00,440
No matter what you hear,

224
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:01,960
don't come out.

225
00:16:02,670 --> 00:16:03,600
Don't worry.

226
00:16:04,030 --> 00:16:06,510
Back when that
Emperor's army reached Jinling,

227
00:16:06,750 --> 00:16:09,000
your father was better
at hiding than anyone.

228
00:16:09,390 --> 00:16:11,670
No lamps in the house.

229
00:16:12,030 --> 00:16:14,720
No moving around and no making a sound.

230
00:16:15,270 --> 00:16:17,240
Make it seem as though no one's home.

231
00:16:36,630 --> 00:16:40,960
No lamps,
no moving around, and no making a sound.

232
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,320
Even prisoners in the imperial prison

233
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:46,000
don't have to suffer like this.

234
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:57,720
You're too troubled
to sleep too, Mother?

235
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:00,270
There is a curfew at night.

236
00:17:00,670 --> 00:17:02,750
Soldiers guard
the entrances to every ward.

237
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:04,790
No one dares wander around.

238
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:08,680
Lanxiang is just worrying over nothing

239
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,510
and frightening everyone.

240
00:17:13,310 --> 00:17:14,680
Mother,

241
00:17:15,510 --> 00:17:17,400
with so many people crammed
into one room,

242
00:17:17,480 --> 00:17:18,920
none of us can get any proper rest.

243
00:17:19,270 --> 00:17:22,400
Why don't we each go back
to our own rooms and get some sleep?

244
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:25,240
That way, we'll have the energy tomorrow

245
00:17:25,350 --> 00:17:26,424
to deal with Du Cuique.

246
00:17:27,110 --> 00:17:30,110
Mother.

247
00:17:31,510 --> 00:17:33,110
Stop going on about it to me.

248
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:35,030
Lanxiang is in charge
of the household now.

249
00:17:35,064 --> 00:17:37,070
If you want to go back
to your own courtyard,

250
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:38,790
go ask Lanxiang.

251
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:47,350
All this fuss over nothing.

252
00:17:47,350 --> 00:17:48,840
You're only scaring yourselves.

253
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:52,070
Du Cuique is just one woman.

254
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:54,030
How dangerous could she possibly be?

255
00:17:59,830 --> 00:18:02,480
Fire!

256
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:03,720
Come put out the fire!

257
00:18:04,568 --> 00:18:06,970
- Jinling City has twenty-five wards.
- Fire! There's a fire!

258
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:08,200
Come put out the fire!

259
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:09,200
Three months ago,

260
00:18:09,256 --> 00:18:11,800
- I sent men to infiltrate the wards.
- Put out the fire!

261
00:18:11,944 --> 00:18:13,740
They familiarized themselves
with the terrain

262
00:18:13,750 --> 00:18:15,640
and searched
for suitable places to start fires,

263
00:18:16,070 --> 00:18:17,750
while secretly spreading rumors

264
00:18:17,864 --> 00:18:19,750
that the Wona people
were bloodthirsty killers.

265
00:18:19,750 --> 00:18:20,750
The Wona are here!

266
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:22,830
The Wona have breached the capital!

267
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:25,030
They've reached Jinling!

268
00:18:25,110 --> 00:18:26,720
They've reached Jinling!

269
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:28,350
Once the time was right,

270
00:18:28,830 --> 00:18:29,960
it would take only a few men

271
00:18:30,830 --> 00:18:32,240
to throw the entire city

272
00:18:32,350 --> 00:18:33,720
into panic.

273
00:19:50,740 --> 00:19:53,020
(Longjiang Pass Wharf)

274
00:19:53,030 --> 00:19:55,440
All the provisions loaded aboard
have been inspected.

275
00:19:55,830 --> 00:19:57,680
We're about to set sail.

276
00:19:58,270 --> 00:19:59,830
The fate of the realm is at stake.

277
00:20:00,110 --> 00:20:02,680
Stay vigilant throughout the journey.

278
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:03,960
- Yes.
- Yes.

279
00:20:19,590 --> 00:20:22,400
The auspicious hour has arrived.
Prepare to set sail.

280
00:20:22,590 --> 00:20:23,480
- Yes.
- Yes.

281
00:21:13,300 --> 00:21:16,220
(Glorify the Family Name)

282
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:23,460
(Glorify the Family Name)

283
00:22:36,590 --> 00:22:37,640
Xu Lanxiang,

284
00:22:39,880 --> 00:22:40,960
you're now

285
00:22:42,480 --> 00:22:44,750
the Marchioness
of Marquis Jing'an's Residence.

286
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:48,920
Even with Jinling's
defenses stretched thin,

287
00:22:49,550 --> 00:22:51,550
you should have sent a few more soldiers

288
00:22:52,168 --> 00:22:53,790
to at least put on a show of strength.

289
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:56,440
Just these few women?

290
00:22:58,030 --> 00:22:58,750
Do you really

291
00:22:59,830 --> 00:23:02,550
expect them to cry, make a scene,
and threaten to hang themselves

292
00:23:03,590 --> 00:23:04,920
to scare me away?

293
00:23:06,550 --> 00:23:07,720
Recently, the Imperial Theater

294
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:09,880
has been staging a new play

295
00:23:10,072 --> 00:23:11,880
called The Tale of the Burning Lamps.

296
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:13,920
You really should go see it.

297
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:16,830
Where is Lin Jinqi?

298
00:23:18,240 --> 00:23:20,400
As Commander of the Longjiang Garrison,

299
00:23:20,720 --> 00:23:24,030
His Lordship was ordered by Minister Han
to escort provisions to the capital.

300
00:23:24,328 --> 00:23:26,440
Naturally, he's carrying out
his official duties,

301
00:23:26,640 --> 00:23:28,000
guarding the provisions

302
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:32,200
against traitors conspiring
with Wona to cause trouble

303
00:23:32,880 --> 00:23:34,790
and attempting to burn the provisions.

304
00:23:40,590 --> 00:23:41,400
You...

305
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:45,750
When did you find out I planned
to burn the provisions?

306
00:23:52,960 --> 00:23:54,510
The day we received the flower ornament.

307
00:23:56,480 --> 00:23:58,550
Someone like you who operates
in the shadows

308
00:23:59,070 --> 00:24:00,440
would seek revenge

309
00:24:00,750 --> 00:24:03,070
by plotting from some dark corner.

310
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:05,350
Yet you not only openly

311
00:24:05,350 --> 00:24:07,000
killed Marquis Yongchang,

312
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:09,400
but deliberately let Ding Peng escape

313
00:24:09,590 --> 00:24:11,432
so he could bring back
the flower ornament.

314
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:13,750
That's not like you.

315
00:24:15,030 --> 00:24:16,000
His Lordship and I

316
00:24:16,550 --> 00:24:18,070
naturally had to calm down

317
00:24:18,920 --> 00:24:20,070
and think it through.

318
00:24:22,030 --> 00:24:23,680
The autumn weather is dry.

319
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:27,160
The provisions can easily catch fire.

320
00:24:28,270 --> 00:24:30,070
A few sparks would be enough.

321
00:24:31,030 --> 00:24:34,400
Whether Lin Jinqi can protect
the provisions

322
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:36,110
remains to be seen.

323
00:24:39,960 --> 00:24:40,960
Xu Lanxiang,

324
00:24:42,590 --> 00:24:43,640
tonight,

325
00:24:45,160 --> 00:24:46,920
you will die.

326
00:24:47,860 --> 00:24:51,340
(Glorify the Family Name)

327
00:27:42,790 --> 00:27:44,030
The scriptures say,

328
00:27:44,640 --> 00:27:46,960
"From one lamp, many lamps are lit,

329
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:50,310
until ten thousand lamps shine bright."

330
00:28:14,320 --> 00:28:14,710
Oil?

331
00:28:16,030 --> 00:28:17,310
- Oil?
- Oil?

332
00:28:49,510 --> 00:28:51,110
I advise you all to stay back.

333
00:28:52,110 --> 00:28:53,790
Du Cuique has a firearm.

334
00:28:54,030 --> 00:28:55,680
She must be carrying incendiary charges.

335
00:28:56,110 --> 00:28:57,480
Once they catch fire,

336
00:28:58,400 --> 00:28:59,880
they'll explode.

337
00:29:00,830 --> 00:29:01,680
Kill her!

338
00:29:03,070 --> 00:29:04,640
Kill that wretched servant!

339
00:29:13,510 --> 00:29:14,920
Zhang Shuizai is dead!

340
00:29:14,930 --> 00:29:17,100
The pirates sent to burn
the provisions are all dead!

341
00:29:17,110 --> 00:29:18,830
His Lordship has won a decisive victory!

342
00:29:18,952 --> 00:29:20,480
- It's a trap!
- We've been tricked!

343
00:29:20,480 --> 00:29:21,670
- Zhang Shuizai is dead!
- Run! Go!

344
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:23,640
- The pirates sent to burn the provisions are dead!
- Run!

345
00:29:23,752 --> 00:29:25,432
His Lordship has won a decisive victory!

346
00:29:25,450 --> 00:29:26,070
Run! Hurry!

347
00:29:35,440 --> 00:29:36,270
Kill her!

348
00:29:37,110 --> 00:29:38,070
Kill them!

349
00:29:38,480 --> 00:29:39,640
Kill her!

350
00:29:55,540 --> 00:29:57,940
(Glorify the Family Name)

351
00:30:00,480 --> 00:30:01,510
Xu Lanxiang,

352
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:06,110
you want me dead?

353
00:30:07,310 --> 00:30:08,110
Fine.

354
00:30:09,270 --> 00:30:10,110
Fine.

355
00:30:11,640 --> 00:30:13,640
Then come to hell with me!

356
00:30:42,350 --> 00:30:43,550
Xu Lanxiang!

357
00:30:43,680 --> 00:30:44,640
Die!

358
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:58,640
Die! Die!

359
00:31:15,750 --> 00:31:17,510
Xu Lanxiang!

360
00:31:54,060 --> 00:31:57,960
♪Like passing clouds,
fierce and unforgettable♪

361
00:31:58,650 --> 00:32:02,400
♪How can I fill
the emptiness deep within?♪

362
00:32:03,210 --> 00:32:06,320
♪It fell into my heart♪

363
00:32:06,740 --> 00:32:10,380
♪And has never faded away♪

364
00:32:11,680 --> 00:32:15,120
♪If there were a promise♪

365
00:32:16,440 --> 00:32:16,960
Lanxiang!

366
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:19,480
Lanxiang!

367
00:32:20,960 --> 00:32:21,480
Lanxiang!

368
00:32:24,680 --> 00:32:26,400
Lanxiang, are you all right?

369
00:32:26,830 --> 00:32:27,680
I'm fine.

370
00:32:28,140 --> 00:32:30,340
♪Those things I can't forget♪

371
00:32:30,560 --> 00:32:34,550
♪The absurdities
I can't let go of fill every page♪

372
00:32:35,830 --> 00:32:36,270
Madam!

373
00:32:39,310 --> 00:32:41,550
I'm fine. What about you?

374
00:32:42,750 --> 00:32:43,510
We're fine.

375
00:32:44,840 --> 00:32:47,430
♪Memories hide away again♪

376
00:32:47,560 --> 00:32:48,910
♪Silent, yet♪

377
00:32:48,920 --> 00:32:51,660
♪They never stop shining♪

378
00:32:51,790 --> 00:32:53,680
♪Still burning bright♪

379
00:32:53,900 --> 00:32:56,640
♪That's what made me who I am♪

380
00:32:56,640 --> 00:33:00,960
♪The best days of my life♪

381
00:33:01,570 --> 00:33:05,080
♪Etched into my heart♪

382
00:33:05,110 --> 00:33:05,590
I'm fine.

383
00:33:05,590 --> 00:33:06,590
These past few years,

384
00:33:07,880 --> 00:33:10,440
whenever I couldn't sleep alone,

385
00:33:10,920 --> 00:33:12,590
I'd play the pipa to pass the time.

386
00:33:14,680 --> 00:33:15,830
I never imagined that today,

387
00:33:17,160 --> 00:33:18,680
I'd use it to take revenge.

388
00:33:26,680 --> 00:33:28,070
She truly got what she deserved.

389
00:33:30,504 --> 00:33:33,320
There's a reward for helping
the authorities capture the pirates.

390
00:33:33,680 --> 00:33:34,720
Will we get one, too?

391
00:33:43,440 --> 00:33:44,480
Madam said

392
00:33:44,536 --> 00:33:46,030
the reward is fifty taels of silver.

393
00:33:46,550 --> 00:33:47,680
Everyone will get a share.

394
00:33:50,830 --> 00:33:51,750
That's wonderful!

395
00:33:54,310 --> 00:33:55,000
That's wonderful!

396
00:34:05,070 --> 00:34:06,680
His Lordship has won a decisive victory.

397
00:34:07,350 --> 00:34:08,630
Was anyone hurt?

398
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:14,510
The city gates are closed.

399
00:34:15,550 --> 00:34:17,670
How could we know
what's happening outside the city?

400
00:34:19,384 --> 00:34:21,540
I was just giving them
a taste of their own medicine.

401
00:34:22,296 --> 00:34:24,230
I deliberately had people shout
those words

402
00:34:24,710 --> 00:34:26,000
as a bluff

403
00:34:27,230 --> 00:34:29,110
to throw the pirates into disarray.

404
00:34:37,800 --> 00:34:39,230
His Lordship promised Zhangcheng

405
00:34:41,670 --> 00:34:43,590
that he would bring Nanke and Jiugao

406
00:34:44,760 --> 00:34:45,840
back safely.

407
00:37:50,590 --> 00:37:51,880
Three against one.

408
00:37:52,440 --> 00:37:53,960
You treacherous cowards.

409
00:38:04,800 --> 00:38:06,110
Lin Jinqi,

410
00:38:07,280 --> 00:38:09,480
if you dare, kill me with one strike.

411
00:38:15,840 --> 00:38:17,070
Don't kill him.

412
00:38:18,480 --> 00:38:20,270
Have him sent
to the Ministry of Justice.

413
00:38:22,190 --> 00:38:26,920
Robbing imperial tribute,
murdering court officials,

414
00:38:27,800 --> 00:38:30,070
colluding with Wona
to burn the provisions,

415
00:38:31,480 --> 00:38:33,070
and committing treason.

416
00:38:33,480 --> 00:38:34,960
Whether principal or accomplice,

417
00:38:35,320 --> 00:38:36,110
under the law,

418
00:38:36,800 --> 00:38:38,440
all shall be executed
by a thousand cuts.

419
00:38:47,400 --> 00:38:48,710
Make sure the executioner knows

420
00:38:49,320 --> 00:38:50,840
there must be a thousand cuts,

421
00:38:52,110 --> 00:38:53,480
not one fewer.

422
00:38:55,110 --> 00:38:55,590
Yes.

423
00:38:56,376 --> 00:38:57,670
Rest assured, Your Lordship.

424
00:39:00,110 --> 00:39:02,590
To honor the spirits of Marquis Yuan,

425
00:39:03,150 --> 00:39:04,440
Commander Ding,

426
00:39:04,550 --> 00:39:06,510
and all our fallen brothers,

427
00:39:06,960 --> 00:39:10,030
there will be more, not fewer.

428
00:39:36,500 --> 00:39:38,856
The pirates scattered sulfur powder
over the provisions.

429
00:39:38,920 --> 00:39:40,700
I wasn't comfortable
leaving it unattended,

430
00:39:40,710 --> 00:39:42,470
so I stayed to make sure
the soldiers cleaned it all up.

431
00:39:42,480 --> 00:39:43,670
That delayed me somewhat.

432
00:39:43,752 --> 00:39:45,640
Sorry to have kept you waiting,
Assistant Commander Xu.

433
00:39:45,920 --> 00:39:47,480
You killed over a hundred pirates

434
00:39:48,150 --> 00:39:49,590
and captured more than twenty alive.

435
00:39:49,880 --> 00:39:50,880
As the bait,

436
00:39:51,320 --> 00:39:52,440
I have fulfilled my mission.

437
00:39:52,616 --> 00:39:55,480
Many thanks to Duke Xiangguo and
Assistant Commander Xu for your help.

438
00:39:56,400 --> 00:39:57,000
Take him away.

439
00:39:57,150 --> 00:39:57,670
Move!

440
00:40:04,110 --> 00:40:04,590
Go!

441
00:40:08,440 --> 00:40:10,400
The Xu family descends
from a founding general.

442
00:40:10,584 --> 00:40:12,872
My father's generation is only
the third since then.

443
00:40:13,510 --> 00:40:15,550
Our ancestor's valor
has not yet been forgotten.

444
00:40:17,030 --> 00:40:17,840
It's just that...

445
00:40:22,150 --> 00:40:24,840
I'll leave things here
to you, Marquis Lin.

446
00:40:25,360 --> 00:40:27,800
I must hurry back
to oversee His Grace's funeral.

447
00:40:28,280 --> 00:40:29,150
Funeral?

448
00:40:31,030 --> 00:40:32,030
Duke Xiangguo...

449
00:40:33,710 --> 00:40:36,630
That night,
you had Nanke deliver a secret letter

450
00:40:36,904 --> 00:40:39,670
asking Father to support your plan
to turn their scheme against them

451
00:40:39,670 --> 00:40:40,990
and lure the pirates into a trap.

452
00:40:41,000 --> 00:40:43,750
Father was already struggling
to hold on as he made the arrangements.

453
00:40:43,760 --> 00:40:45,110
Not long after Nanke left,

454
00:40:45,480 --> 00:40:46,880
Father passed away.

455
00:40:47,672 --> 00:40:49,070
Before he died, he instructed us

456
00:40:50,670 --> 00:40:52,000
to keep his death secret

457
00:40:52,232 --> 00:40:53,550
in order to maintain morale.

458
00:40:53,880 --> 00:40:55,480
If we failed to protect the provisions,

459
00:40:56,088 --> 00:40:58,056
the realm and our family
would both be lost.

460
00:40:58,510 --> 00:41:00,480
Then he would rather
be left without a burial.

461
00:41:00,776 --> 00:41:02,568
If we succeeded
in protecting the provisions,

462
00:41:03,840 --> 00:41:05,400
I was to return and lay him to rest.

463
00:41:24,200 --> 00:41:26,280
When you pay your respects
before his spirit tablet,

464
00:41:26,456 --> 00:41:28,440
please offer three sticks of incense
on my behalf

465
00:41:29,150 --> 00:41:30,590
and tell Duke Xiangguo

466
00:41:31,670 --> 00:41:33,070
that I will deliver the provisions

467
00:41:33,630 --> 00:41:35,670
safely and intact to the capital

468
00:41:35,752 --> 00:41:37,544
and hand them over to Minister Han.

469
00:41:41,070 --> 00:41:41,550
All right.

470
00:42:01,460 --> 00:42:03,580
♪My thoughts are like a red umbrella♪

471
00:42:04,170 --> 00:42:06,230
♪Drifting through the rain♪

472
00:42:07,710 --> 00:42:08,150
Go.

473
00:42:08,950 --> 00:42:11,530
♪Held tightly in my hand,
shielding me from hidden currents♪

474
00:42:12,020 --> 00:42:16,690
♪How could a thousand words
soothe this aching heart?♪

475
00:42:16,790 --> 00:42:22,240
♪With guilt in my heart,
how could I ask to meet again?♪

476
00:42:23,960 --> 00:42:29,020
♪May I be like
a firefly awakening in the dark♪

477
00:42:29,260 --> 00:42:34,580
♪Even if I only illuminate
a single corner♪

478
00:42:35,060 --> 00:42:39,950
♪If I could bring light
to someone's eyes♪

479
00:42:40,200 --> 00:42:50,780
♪I'd spend this life
and call it courage♪

480
00:42:50,880 --> 00:42:52,500
Set sail!

481
00:42:52,500 --> 00:42:53,900
- Set sail!
- Set sail!

482
00:42:53,900 --> 00:42:54,860
Press on day and night!

483
00:42:54,860 --> 00:42:55,850
- Press on day and night!
- Press on day and night!

484
00:42:55,850 --> 00:42:57,130
Make haste for the capital!

485
00:42:57,130 --> 00:42:59,100
- Make haste for the capital!
- Make haste for the capital!

486
00:42:59,110 --> 00:42:59,960
- Yes!
- Yes!

487
00:43:05,020 --> 00:43:07,940
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

488
00:43:09,480 --> 00:43:11,190
The Wona forces have withdrawn!

489
00:43:11,440 --> 00:43:11,880
What?

490
00:43:12,030 --> 00:43:12,710
Really?

491
00:43:13,280 --> 00:43:15,030
The Wona army has retreated!

492
00:43:15,070 --> 00:43:17,000
The Wona forces have withdrawn!

493
00:43:17,550 --> 00:43:20,110
The Wona army has retreated!

494
00:44:04,820 --> 00:44:08,940
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

495
00:44:11,780 --> 00:44:16,300
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

496
00:44:17,580 --> 00:44:21,500
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

497
00:44:22,180 --> 00:44:24,940
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

498
00:44:25,660 --> 00:44:27,980
♪Though all the world may fade♪

499
00:44:27,980 --> 00:44:31,060
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

500
00:44:32,580 --> 00:44:36,820
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

501
00:44:39,740 --> 00:44:43,900
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

502
00:44:45,700 --> 00:44:49,260
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

503
00:44:49,260 --> 00:44:52,820
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

504
00:44:53,620 --> 00:44:59,300
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

505
00:44:59,660 --> 00:45:03,980
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

506
00:45:04,340 --> 00:45:07,300
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

507
00:45:07,300 --> 00:45:11,060
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

508
00:45:11,060 --> 00:45:13,940
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

509
00:45:13,940 --> 00:45:18,020
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

510
00:45:18,020 --> 00:45:21,380
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

511
00:45:21,380 --> 00:45:25,140
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

512
00:45:25,140 --> 00:45:29,140
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

513
00:45:29,900 --> 00:45:34,060
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

514
00:45:34,060 --> 00:45:37,500
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

515
00:45:37,500 --> 00:45:41,140
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

516
00:45:41,140 --> 00:45:44,020
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

517
00:45:44,020 --> 00:45:48,100
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

518
00:45:48,100 --> 00:45:51,460
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

519
00:45:51,460 --> 00:45:55,100
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

520
00:45:55,100 --> 00:46:02,900
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
